{"4245410": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Everfall 2: Idle Dungeon RPG", "steam_appid": 4245410, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Everfall 2: Idle Dungeon RPG</i></strong> is here with some of the biggest dopamine you can find! Try out what could be one of the most fun games of 2026!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/1c13342f08fdc64425abfe695919f212.poster.avif?t=1773435504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/1c13342f08fdc64425abfe695919f212.webm?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/1c13342f08fdc64425abfe695919f212.mp4?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Build Your Party - Customize Your Team!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your squad features four characters of your choosing pick from 6 possible characters, each with many abilities, &amp; build paths to choose from.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/52c323670a37b41a37fb9b8a4af06b3f.poster.avif?t=1773435504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/52c323670a37b41a37fb9b8a4af06b3f.webm?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/52c323670a37b41a37fb9b8a4af06b3f.mp4?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>ENDGAME IS HUGE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fall is only the beginning. Endgame opens two major systems:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vault Dungeons</strong>  <br>Key-based, loot-heavy boss challenges with scaling rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rune Trials</strong>  <br>High-difficulty boss fights where your build quality will be important. <br><strong>Divine Arena </strong><br>Incredible content that truly gives you the chance to become unbelievably strong. Everfall 2 will not be as easy on you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pinnacle Boss </strong><br>Beating the Pinnacle boss will truly be one of the hardest things to accomplish. Get your chance at UNIQUE WEAPONS! Beating this boss is like beating the game, Good Luck :)<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/8176c27a12470a5a618a652526425661.poster.avif?t=1773435504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/8176c27a12470a5a618a652526425661.webm?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/8176c27a12470a5a618a652526425661.mp4?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Zones with Target Farming!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everfall</strong>: Enemies have +15% HP but deal -15% less damage. Prepare for longer battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stoneforge</strong>: Enemies deal +15% more damage but have -15% less HP. Fast and deadly combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Umbral Depths</strong>: Face 2-5 additional enemies per room, but each enemy has -25% HP and -25% Attack. Survive the swarm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/37625f095a47423864b4a48d169e28e7.poster.avif?t=1773435504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/37625f095a47423864b4a48d169e28e7.webm?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/37625f095a47423864b4a48d169e28e7.mp4?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Loot, Stats, and Gear Progression!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everfall 2 introduces NEW types of gear and UNIQUE Weapons from the NEW Pinnacle Boss! Starting from nothing to slowly equipping better level gear, rarities, keystones, runes, &amp; pets has never felt better. From <i>Common</i>, <i>Uncommon</i>, <i>Rare</i>, <i>Epic</i>, <i>Legendary</i>, <i>Mythic</i>, &amp; even <i>UNIQUE</i> Weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/93b7ba991179a1e1ceb15f0f4034ed17.poster.avif?t=1773435504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/93b7ba991179a1e1ceb15f0f4034ed17.webm?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/93b7ba991179a1e1ceb15f0f4034ed17.mp4?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Everfall 2, we focused a ton of work on proper balancing, while still allowing big numbers &amp; TONS of ENDGAME CONTENT, while still keeping our journey to endgame extremely fun and satisfying. </strong> <br><strong> </strong> <br><strong>The game expands into new systems, while still keeping many of the systems you all know in love.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Everfall 2: Idle Dungeon RPG</i></strong> is here with some of the biggest dopamine you can find! Try out what could be one of the most fun games of 2026!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/1c13342f08fdc64425abfe695919f212.poster.avif?t=1773435504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/1c13342f08fdc64425abfe695919f212.webm?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/1c13342f08fdc64425abfe695919f212.mp4?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Build Your Party - Customize Your Team!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your squad features four characters of your choosing pick from 6 possible characters, each with many abilities, &amp; build paths to choose from.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/52c323670a37b41a37fb9b8a4af06b3f.poster.avif?t=1773435504\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/52c323670a37b41a37fb9b8a4af06b3f.webm?t=1773435504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4245410/extras/52c323670a37b41a37fb9b8a4af06b3f.mp4?t=1773435504\" type=\